; Passes left, Horace's lives (byte)
;
; The "PASSES" counter of the status line: number of lives, as a binary number printed as one digit. Set to 3 by #R$6000
; at the start of a game; the first score update then adds a free pass (see #R$7C77), so a game starts with 4. #R$673A
; decrements it when Horace is caught; at 0 the game is over. #R$65C7 increments it for every 10000 points (no upper
; limit).
;
@label=Passes
g$7C78 DEFB $00
